  "query_preview": "/Wednesday through Sunday/...\nIssued 308 AM MST SUN NOV 1 2026\nA weak low pressure system will move east of the area on \nWednesday, resulting in breezy afternoon winds but no \nprecipitation. Additional systems will move by to the north on \nThursday and Friday, resulting in a 10-30% chance of showers on\nThursday and a 20-40% chance on Friday, highest across the \nnorth. An upper level ridge will build back in over the weekend \nwith dry conditions returning. The weak systems Wednesday \nthrough Friday will bring slight cooling, but temperatures will \nstill be near normal. Slightly warmer temperatures will arrive \nover the weekend as the ridge builds in.",
